Description: remove the Dolphin suffix from window titles
 Dolphin Clean Title removes one trailing "— Dolphin" or "- Dolphin"
 suffix from Dolphin window titles while leaving Dolphin itself unchanged.
 It provides a native settings application and a user-local activation
 workflow for X11 and XWayland sessions.
